  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759112,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 10-Pin Bowling - Nintendo Game Boy Color\n\nStep into the classic American bowling alley with *10-Pin Bowling* for the Game Boy Color! This isn't just a game; it's a virtual recreation of the beloved pastime, bringing the sights, sounds, and nostalgia of the lanes directly to your handheld. Forget waiting for an open lane – enjoy a perfect game anytime, anywhere.\n\n*10-Pin Bowling* delivers a surprisingly detailed experience, from the polished mahogany lanes to the satisfying clatter of pins. Hone your skills and work on your average before the leagues begin! The gameplay is straightforward and accessible, focusing on mastering your aim and power to achieve strikes and spares. Experience the thrill of a 7-10 split or strive for that elusive perfect game. Whether you're a seasoned bowler or a complete beginner, *10-Pin Bowling* offers a fun and engaging virtual bowling experience. Get ready to roll!"
    },
